<title>INDIA: India minister urges RBI to cut export credit rate.</title>
<headline>India minister urges RBI to cut export credit rate.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian Commerce Minister Bolla Buli Ramaiah on Tuesday urged the Reserve Bank of India (RBI) to consider cutting the interest rate on export credit to about 10 or 11 percent from 13 percent.</p>
</text>
